            "classifiers": [],
            "description": "PhpDiscord - easy, remembering , and have more functions.\n\nSample code with ban and kick commands :\n```py\nfrom phpdiscord import Discord\nfrom phpdiscord.enums import ApplicationCommandType, ApplicationCommandOptionType\nfrom phpdiscord.models import ApplicationCommandOptionChoice\n\nclient = Discord(\"<your-bot-token>\")\n\n# Define the /ban command with mention and reason options\nban_command = {\n    \"name\": \"ban\",\n    \"description\": \"Ban a user from the server.\",\n    \"type\": ApplicationCommandType.CHAT_INPUT.value,\n    \"options\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"user\",\n            \"description\": \"The user to ban.\",\n            \"type\": ApplicationCommandOptionType.USER.value,\n            \"required\": True\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"reason\",\n            \"description\": \"The reason for the ban.\",\n            \"type\": ApplicationCommandOptionType.STRING.value,\n            \"required\": False\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\n# Define the /kick command with mention and reason options\nkick_command = {\n    \"name\": \"kick\",\n    \"description\": \"Kick a user from the server.\",\n    \"type\": ApplicationCommandType.CHAT_INPUT.value,\n    \"options\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"user\",\n            \"description\": \"The user to kick.\",\n            \"type\": ApplicationCommandOptionType.USER.value,\n            \"required\": True\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"reason\",\n            \"description\": \"The reason for the kick.\",\n            \"type\": ApplicationCommandOptionType.STRING.value,\n            \"required\": False\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\n# Register the commands\nclient.application_commands.create(ban_command)\nclient.application_commands.create(kick_command)\n\n# Handle the /ban command\n@client.interactions.on(\"ban\")\ndef handle_ban_command(interaction):\n    user = interaction.options[\"user\"].user\n    reason = interaction.options[\"reason\"].value if \"reason\" in interaction.options else None\n    mention = f\"<@{user.id}>\"\n    response = f\"{mention} has been banned\"\n    if reason:\n        response += f\" for {reason}\"\n    interaction.response.send_message(response)\n\n# Handle the /kick command\n@client.interactions.on(\"kick\")\ndef handle_kick_command(interaction):\n    user = interaction.options[\"user\"].user\n    reason = interaction.options[\"reason\"].value if \"reason\" in interaction.options else None\n    mention = f\"<@{user.id}>\"\n    response = f\"{mention} has been kicked\"\n    if reason:\n        response += f\" for {reason}\"\n    interaction.response.send_message(response)\n\nclient.run()```\n\nPhpdiscord ussing class Discord for inclusion your bot !\n\nDont forget <your-\nbot-token> change to your token.\n\n",
